* Mutant: the tail mirror ratio is five times the reference, so the OTA burns more than 0.5 mW
.subckt ota_5t vss ibias vdd vinn vinp vout
XM1 nleft vinp tail vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.9 w=90 nf=10
XM2 vout vinn tail vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.9 w=90 nf=10
XM3 nleft nleft vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.9 w=100 nf=20
XM4 vout nleft vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.9 w=100 nf=20
XM5 tail ibias vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=1.5 w=1500 nf=150
XM6 ibias ibias vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=1.5 w=90 nf=9
.ends ota_5t
